    "Registration uses the harness's own fetch to the public /auth/register to read Retry-After; sign-in uses TestApiClient.loginPassword.",
    "The API pool and, on macOS, the API descriptor limit are taken from the manifest declaration; a declared pool above 25, Redis or more than one replica is refused.",
